<section background-color="heading">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="38" vertical-align="center">
      <p role="eyebrow">Nguyễn Du · The Tale of Kiều</p>
      <h1 font-size="44pt">A poem carried by its rhythm</h1>
      <p font-size="lg"><b>Truyện Kiều turns a life under pressure into a test of how we judge choice.</b></p>
      <p>Alternating six- and eight-syllable lines carry Thúy Kiều from vow to sacrifice, exploitation, resistance, and return. Narrative, ethics, and poetic form operate as one achievement.</p>
      <spacer mode="fixed" size="18pt"/>
      <hr horizontalAlign="left" width="xs" thickness="md" color="accent"/>
      <p font-size="sm">Character · social realism · humanitarian value · lục bát</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="22" padding="0">
      <ai-image prompt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, an open manuscript folio without legible writing beside a river threshold and a narrow vermilion cord passing forward through the composition, Vietnamese chữ Nôm woodblock sensibility, lampblack, old gold and indigo under soft window light, no text or lettering" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" aspect-ratio="portrait" fill="true"/>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
  <shape preset="line" x="56" y="454" w="848" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape>
</section>